        "type": "text",
        "id": "page-zonda-c12-para-1203",
        "x": 64,
        "y": 1203,
        "name": "page-zonda-c12-para-1203",
        "fill": "#F3F2ED",
        "content": "Despite the peculiar concept behind its design, the supercar features a fibre carbon monocoque and a Mercedes-Benz AMG engine that is capable of unleashing as much as 394 hp with a maximum torque of 570 Nm.",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "fontWeight": "400",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 97
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "page-zonda-c12-para-1322",
        "x": 64,
        "y": 1322,
        "name": "page-zonda-c12-para-1322",
        "fill": "#F3F2ED",
        "content": "The choice of mounting the V12 Mercedes engine in a central position has enabled the Zonda C12 to attain high performance levels of torque and power, while achieving overall weight reduction. Furthermore, thanks to the utilization of state-of-the-art composite materials for the chassis and the bodywork, the car structure is highly resistant and light at the same time, while guaranteeing extreme driver comfort.",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "fontWeight": "400",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 167
